\details{
Provides methods for margin borrowing, repaying, order management, and
account queries on Binance. Inherits from \link{BinanceBase}.
\subsection{Purpose and Scope}{
\itemize{
\item \strong{Borrowing / Repaying}: Borrow and repay assets on cross or isolated margin.
\item \strong{Order Management}: Place, cancel, and query margin orders.
\item \strong{Account Info}: Query margin account details, max borrowable/transferable amounts.
\item \strong{History}: Retrieve interest history, force liquidation records, and trade history.
\item \strong{Isolated Margin}: Query isolated margin accounts and initiate isolated transfers.
}
}

\subsection{Usage}{

All methods require authentication (valid API key and secret).
These are SAPI (\verb{/sapi/}) endpoints.
}

\subsection{Official Documentation}{

\href{https://developers.binance.com/docs/margin_trading/Introduction}{Binance Margin Trading}
}

